# Allowlist: only the exploration work is tracked for now. Everything at the top level is
# ignored by default, so the 7 GB of model weights, Flutter build output and datasets in
# this directory can never be added by accident. Add paths deliberately below.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/exploration/

# Inside exploration/: track code, docs and results — never weights or audio.
# These are the self-contained bundle's assets; the ONNX alone is 135 MB, over GitHub's
# 100 MB hard limit. See exploration/README.md for how to rebuild them locally.
/exploration/notebooks/assets/
/exploration/notebooks/__marimo__/

# The sample manifest IS tracked: it names exactly which 250 clips every result used,
# which is the provenance the measurements rest on. The audio itself is not.
/exploration/notebooks/data/*
!/exploration/notebooks/data/sample.tsv
